{"time": 1763576195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387653724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“最快也是明天了，还是加班加点的情况下”匠人如是说"}
{"time": 1763576230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062197821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那麻烦您了，我们明天过来取”"}
{"time": 1763576300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883980701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好嘞，希望几位满意”"}
{"time": 1763576361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132130282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（按理说是不是该问男款女款（）"}
{"time": 1763576399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144987930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...谢谢\""}
{"time": 1763576426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001503345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们去买点水吧，然后就上山看看？”"}
{"time": 1763576643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927549145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩带着我走就好了。\""}
{"time": 1763576783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334162457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说大叔...那座山有没有修上去的路啊”先打听一下，要是只有崎岖的小路还是算了，有点危险"}
{"time": 1763577017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904937830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“山？有那么一条石道，凿了阶梯出来。不过很少有人上去……有一部分信仰原因在吧，也没什么风景，毕竟连颗树都没有”"}
{"time": 1763577055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724037088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我们要去吗？\""}
{"time": 1763577078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782631243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“信仰原因是？”"}
{"time": 1763577197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90266235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“村子能发展到现在这个地步，和圣山的馈赠离不开嘛，不论是旅游、矿藏……还有水源。冬天的时候它还会阻挡寒风”"}
{"time": 1763577216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470431490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以也有叫它母亲山的说法”"}
{"time": 1763577256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629558067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，这个我知道，就像母亲河一样。\"点点肉，\"这样的话，路况可能确实不太好...\""}
{"time": 1763577284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016805853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（猜你想打点点头）"}
{"time": 1763577325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595261094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有阶梯的话...应该还好吧，或者舒茉有什么想去的地方吗”"}
{"time": 1763577519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986357314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然伊恩这么说，那就爬吧。\""}
