{"time": 1763604224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126683393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先去买一些水之类的，然后和舒茉去山脚下，开始爬山"}
{"time": 1763604512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431739998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之是瓶子比水贵，你买了两个小竹筒的水，又踏上那条可以说的上是村庄命脉的路"}
{"time": 1763604618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374805188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着宛若登天的山路，露出了些畏惧的神色，但是...既然已经答应下来，掩面摇摇脑袋，跟着一起上山。"}
{"time": 1763604691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855439655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一路上当然是牵着舒茉的手“没事啦，走到哪里是哪里，我们也不一定非要登顶”"}
{"time": 1763604842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11815738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...既然来了，舒茉会努力的。”语气柔柔弱弱，但依然带着些倔强"}
{"time": 1763604878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452602596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "路上倒是没什么人在意你们，看来迈尔斯并没有对村民宣传你们。上山的路离矿坑入口不近，台阶陡峭且无扶手，不过好消息是并不开在山体最边缘，两侧都有岩石做围，昨晚也没有下雨"}
{"time": 1763604998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740296871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "陡峭的台阶一看就鲜有人来，爬得小心翼翼"}
{"time": 1763605030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345897461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢的走着，不敢走的太快"}
{"time": 1763605269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280397756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只是随便爬了几十阶，回头看过去，已经比村子里最高的建筑还要高得多了。和从地面上看完全不一样，看不见屋檐看不清窗户，但是黑的、白的、斑驳的屋顶让你们意识到这是全新的视角"}
{"time": 1763605272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767681213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这路没想到这么不好...“"}
{"time": 1763605284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030518616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没想到在哪）"}
{"time": 1763605344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728438581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过能看到不一样的风景呢。”拂过发丝，回望小镇，“嗯，不要掉下去了。”"}
{"time": 1763605449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67555190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先继续走吧，等到比较适合休息的地方，我们再慢慢欣赏风景吧，对了，舒茉你渴了吗”"}
{"time": 1763605453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767422798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "日头在西斜，不如说来的路上就花了不少时间。天边还没挂上霞光，但凉风已经吹起来了"}
{"time": 1763605510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268784336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=67555190]要说渴虽然并没有很渴，但是现在果然还是，“嗯，有一点啦。”"}
{"time": 1763605567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681699857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，感觉今天应该到不了山顶了”往上看看有没有什么临时休息的凉亭，随后把水递给舒茉"}
{"time": 1763605617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966888611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然有点想尝试一些更复杂的动作，比如说直接喂她喝，但是碍于崎岖的山路还是算了"}
{"time": 1763605629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387215342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（路就没修到山顶）"}
{"time": 1763605647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445824241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一开始就说了，没怎么开发）"}
{"time": 1763605692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574645860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过竹筒，倒也没急着喝水，上了一路的山，一直有些禁不住的喘息，干脆坐在台阶上，看着远处的风景。"}
{"time": 1763605698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479503813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是台阶陡峭的好处就是可以直接坐在台阶上）"}
{"time": 1763605803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331016480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不今天就先爬到这吧....”也转身坐在她的身旁，不过倒也没有怎么看风景，而是看着舒茉的侧颜"}
{"time": 1763605808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607853206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "山上没有凉亭，百步以后，那些说不定长了千年的树也再没有能高过你们的了"}
{"time": 1763605852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849183791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉这座山很适合讲那个故事）"}
{"time": 1763605876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71511615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“要是现在掉下去会怎么样？”语气轻快，摇晃着双腿，一边指着山下，一边侧过脑袋看向伊恩，发觉他在看着自己，“嗯...怎么盯着我看啦...”"}
{"time": 1763605939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244089002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（永恒有多久？\n在时间的尽头有座钻石山，这座山有两英里长，两英里宽，两英里高；\n每隔一百年有一只鸟飞来，用它的嘴来啄山，然后飞走。\n等整个山都被啄掉时，永恒的第一秒就结束了。\n）"}
{"time": 1763606022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743843210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我连宇宙的尽头不知道，怎么会知道这个）"}
{"time": 1763606024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597889386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "已经和舒茉捅破了那层窗户纸“因为舒茉很漂亮啊”直言不讳的说到"}
{"time": 1763606025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080083674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，今天开炫彩商店）"}
{"time": 1763606037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618757935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1763606050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511952295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（买点炫彩去，我现在好多精粹）"}
{"time": 1763606058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294695229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71511615]（会死啊）"}
{"time": 1763606111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673723333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有不要想那么吓人的事情啦...”听到舒茉说的话，看着来时路，竟莫名感觉到有些腿软"}
{"time": 1763606302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942200478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“往前走的时候果然看不见山有多高呢，适当的时候回头看看...”轻轻把脑袋搭在伊恩的肩膀上，“对了，舒茉漂亮在哪？”声音故意拖长了些~"}
{"time": 1763606337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416260001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B8516BF45569CC5B29DDA26E72B89E7F.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT9Ji2b3nM5eVFI_2JwYMib3E2j3xjRiVsg_woo-paSydn_kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQs8sMvhAG26TYgaRARPWJvnoCbomCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMLeYot8Qwq6S1lsKhlrjb3xZHXzyLdFBgH83dbzpx7MKvqNP5QK5wyA9w66AtyxmgQ,file_size=1492177]（我是青蛙（））"}
{"time": 1763606359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637193736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无言了）"}
{"time": 1763606472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110461312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1763606567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947612086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哪里都很漂亮啦，而且还很协调，所以显得舒茉整体更漂亮啦”搂着舒茉，低头看向她"}
{"time": 1763606666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344641693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有西部天使的炫彩）"}
{"time": 1763606743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430503091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...伊恩，你知道这么说...就和说还行是一个意思吗？”语气里倒是没有责怪的意思，“夸别人，就要说最特别的地方才行，好好记住啦。”"}
{"time": 1763606841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602965942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但我觉得舒茉就是很完美啊”在她的鼻子上轻轻刮一下"}
{"time": 1763606865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772739866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（完美是伪命题（）"}
{"time": 1763607039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424047966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=3A6EFB9142C779C5DACB1EEA6E6BB31E.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQx1lR4wDu-xIaJe004K-Jn4Fat0BjGuA8g_woomJyqmNz_kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHgQUzqw6g5H1xAi4jqjcAnoCgNSCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMLeYot8Qwq6S1lsKhlrjb3xZHXzyLdFBgH83dbzpx7MKvqNP5QK5wyA9w66AtyxmgQ,file_size=252998]（无敌）"}
{"time": 1763607048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882726314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过金蓝是很好的配色）"}
{"time": 1763607080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145257683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=602965942]鼻尖轻轻翕动 ，“如果不说清楚，完美也是搪塞啦...”双手搭在腿上，“先说说，有没有最特别的地方？”"}
{"time": 1763607089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458090363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1882726314]（西部天使？）"}
{"time": 1763607099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383392144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是）"}
{"time": 1763607116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142897441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说舒茉，你可能要问金在哪）"}
{"time": 1763607126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544195797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（金在哪）"}
{"time": 1763607143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003903031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然是太阳）"}
{"time": 1763607177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582709632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1763607388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286163018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emm，舒茉的眼睛很漂亮，感觉像有光一样”"}
{"time": 1763607464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81298334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286163018]“诶...只有这样？”伸手戳一戳他的腰，眯着眼语气促狭"}
{"time": 1763608089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298460692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1424047966]（没绷住，居然赢了，对面有个皇子究极内鬼（bushi））"}
{"time": 1763608194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453108844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（别打了）"}
{"time": 1763608251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137604668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=81298334]\"肯定不止这样啦，手如柔荑，肤如凝脂，这两句感觉就是专门用来形容舒茉的\""}
{"time": 1763608261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522772587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我只是想领个头像（）"}
{"time": 1763608418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022493817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=137604668]“...咦，听着都有些肉麻了。”假装身上起了鸡皮疙瘩的样子，“好啦好啦，舒茉自己倒是觉得...只能算普通吧？”"}
{"time": 1763608476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077573504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉肯定不普通...”环绕四周，应该没什么人吧"}
