{"time": 1763701770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15403908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（嘛，和妈妈讲我觉得问题不大吧）"}
{"time": 1763701776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542669745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她是孤儿你也是孤儿吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1763701813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312721575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（本来就打算倾诉的，拐个弯。）"}
{"time": 1763701824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86596955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=535209246]“呃？不，等等”她在你背后叫住你“什么你觉得我觉得？”"}
{"time": 1763701897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193176870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...?”回过头，却是一脸明媚的笑容，“妈妈在想什么？”"}
{"time": 1763701919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040907863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先眯会）"}
{"time": 1763707075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146781166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（复活）"}
{"time": 1763707112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641012451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神不是汇报？）"}
{"time": 1763707128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350086353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（先开会）"}
{"time": 1763707135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643193015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（汇报要到四点）"}
{"time": 1763707142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694814122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（开会我又不去）"}
{"time": 1763707372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289742507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1193176870]“你们……”舒蕾的表情有些古怪，至少看起来没你那么阳光明媚“亲过了？这么快？”"}
{"time": 1763707652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249279791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”认真地对视了一会之后，自己微微点了点脑袋，脸上的笑容也收了起来，“是舒茉任性了一回...”"}
{"time": 1763707926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198397060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你看见她深深地吸了一口气，憋住了好一会，才慢慢吐出来“好吧好吧，也算是一脉相承了……”"}
{"time": 1763708018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819149428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“倒不是我有什么意见……好吧，就是我有意见”她摇了摇头“他挺好的，就是有时候……怎么说呢”"}
{"time": 1763708075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796235099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "安静地低下脑袋，绞着手指，等待妈妈的下文"}
{"time": 1763708210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333762158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有时候分不清主次啦，而且……少了点灵性”舒蕾斟酌了一会用词“我本来想再敲打敲打的”"}
{"time": 1763708467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248712117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉也不清楚...但是那个时候，就是冲动了一些...\"继续绞手指，\"舒茉是对的吗？妈妈...\"其实知道答案，但还是希望能得到不一样的回答。"}
{"time": 1763708701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483771134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对不对也不取决于我……好吧，不完全取决于我”舒蕾摇了摇头“我不知道他现在的样子是不是就是你最喜欢的样子……我觉得还差点火候。但是既然你已经决定了，你就要自己负责想办法给他加分”"}
{"time": 1763708941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923747629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...往后舒茉再贪心一点点...也可以吧？”贴到妈妈身边，轻轻把自己跌入她的怀中，身体微微有些颤抖，“舒茉，有些害怕不确定的未来...哪方面都有...”"}
{"time": 1763709053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719964334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该调教了）"}
{"time": 1763709240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19109350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哪有确定的未来呢？”舒蕾摇摇头，拨弄着你的头发“我也怕……当然，现在最放不下心的应该是甘纳许小姐。不过大家都有不得不撑下去的理由”"}
{"time": 1763709402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762962222", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...舒茉也明白...”声音有些闷闷地，“嗯...如果到了舒茉放手的时候，舒茉也希望自己可以更果断彻底一些...”"}
{"time": 1763709439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023720699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（放手是？）"}
