{"time": 1763809124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768564062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（出道战就在赫顿玛尔啊）"}
{"time": 1763809136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080414730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（住过好几年好吧）"}
{"time": 1763809138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579910560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh，我还以为她一直都是在西海岸活跃）"}
{"time": 1763809148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729670001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只有冠军赛在那边）"}
{"time": 1763809306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973303164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我跟着妈妈一起吧。\"搭着她的手，\"以前妈妈住在什么地方...过着什么样的生活，舒茉很好奇...\""}
{"time": 1763809384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832625225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:json,data={\"ver\":\"1.0.0.19\"&#44;\"prompt\":\"&#91;QQ小程序&#93;【骑士金曲】《风都是我们守护的家乡》假面骑士W\"&#44;\"config\":{\"type\":\"normal\"&#44;\"width\":0&#44;\"height\":0&#44;\"forward\":1&#44;\"autoSize\":0&#44;\"ctime\":1763809380&#44;\"token\":\"dac7691f09602a2dc53361a12e8f877c\"}&#44;\"needShareCallBack\":false&#44;\"app\":\"com.tencent.miniapp_01\"&#44;\"view\":\"view_8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"meta\":{\"detail_1\":{\"appid\":\"1109937557\"&#44;\"appType\":0&#44;\"title\":\"哔哩哔哩\"&#44;\"desc\":\"【骑士金曲】《风都是我们守护的家乡》假面骑士W\"&#44;\"icon\":\"http:\\/\\/miniapp.gtimg.cn\\/public\\/appicon\\/432b76be3a548fc128acaa6c1ec90131_200.jpg\"&#44;\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/qq.ugcimg.cn\\/v1\\/0p8ol82v8m1tam3dii6au378votqf9fjjbeb0fb8aui0ta094vvdm2a4vk8rgvjesqp436hte8plcoiqq4pqhepjl5ufidbd1i15ajct21cm0tnasej8shojlfe286ps3o0602m5rh71h2crq037kfnddg\\/e9vf2tsqr6j29hl2kodb3vahlc\"&#44;\"url\":\"m.q.qq.com\\/a\\/s\\/145e4c60a1dbf588150713e7ec9a913e\"&#44;\"scene\":1036&#44;\"host\":{\"uin\":1040972910&#44;\"nick\":\"划船不靠桨の233\"}&#44;\"shareTemplateId\":\"8C8E89B49BE609866298ADDFF2DBABA4\"&#44;\"shareTemplateData\":{}&#44;\"qqdocurl\":\"https:\\/\\/b23.tv\\/VhfLfNR?share_medium=android&amp;share_source=qq&amp;bbid=XY987989FE130EACC8C8E16FA6F7F7D8D9EB3&amp;ts=1763809379369\"&#44;\"showLittleTail\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePoints\":\"\"&#44;\"gamePointsUrl\":\"\"&#44;\"shareOrigin\":0}}}]"}
{"time": 1763809402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177020948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呀，被猜到了”舒蕾摸了摸你的脑袋“不过应该也就只能看看……快20年过去了，教会能维持原样，那条小巷子可不太行……”"}
{"time": 1763809577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015306040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没关系啦～\"翻手，摊开手心，脑袋靠着妈妈，\"只要到了那个地方，也许舒茉就能看见过去发生过的事情呢。\""}
{"time": 1763810222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551353970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真的假的……这也是舒茉的，魔法吗？好方便”"}
{"time": 1763810334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319085494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔唔...不确定啦，只是感觉可以做得到。\"得意地扬起脑袋，\"不过看太多舒茉也会很累的。\""}
{"time": 1763810360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1822473574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "被舒茉的话勾起了兴趣“要不再试试？看能不能看到我的过去”"}
{"time": 1763810516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411976743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉总之东西当被动用还是太厉害了）"}
{"time": 1763810520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024737282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（该cost的）"}
{"time": 1763810734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189198942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1822473574]\"又不是没看过...\"想起了那次宛若溺水的体验，皱皱眉，\"倒是快把人家溺死了。\""}
{"time": 1763810777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434978841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那还是算了吧...其实我也不是很在意啦”"}
{"time": 1763811071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980803642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在做不到啦...以后也许可以...抱歉。\""}
{"time": 1763811103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225509136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用啦...我真的不在意啦，只是随口一提”摸摸舒茉的头"}
{"time": 1763811163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763436154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“溺水是……？”舒蕾皱了皱眉“发生了什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1763811256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433449612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，之前深入伊恩的记忆的时候...\"也没有什么隐瞒的必要，\"舒茉感觉被漆黑的水死死淹没，最好几乎是失去呼吸才被迫脱离...\""}
{"time": 1763811364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79839635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是什么时候的事？”舒蕾的眉头没有解开“诶，难道舒茉以前就会魔法了？”"}
{"time": 1763811533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34805117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"思考着，\"舒茉一直都有些被卷入奇怪的记忆里...不过伊恩这个，应该是那天之后吧?之前忘了和妈妈说\""}
{"time": 1763811573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52525907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是总感觉窥探记忆好邪恶（）"}
{"time": 1763811606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688386321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一般也不用)"}
{"time": 1763811741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62722099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”舒蕾只是点了点头，没再说什么，不过怎么看都有心事"}
{"time": 1763811880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482184183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了？\"感觉有点奇怪，\"妈妈看上去有什么心事?\""}
{"time": 1763811942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242645989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没什么……之后再说吧”"}
{"time": 1763811972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728453517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉啦舒茉，都怪我”"}
{"time": 1763812024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751781927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧。\"没有追问下去，\"没事，只是我能力不足吧？\"双手拍拍脸颊，\"如果我能看的更清楚，伊恩也不会对过去一无所知了。\""}
{"time": 1763812384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892780521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我真的不在意啦...有舒茉就足够了”后半句小声"}
{"time": 1763812461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360101489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（眯会）"}
{"time": 1763827667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832470812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 有1吗）"}
{"time": 1763828164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562656899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（估计没有）"}
{"time": 1763828628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033393082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(玩手机)"}
{"time": 1763828793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203427689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=7D191123216E9DABB1AACF49C4BDF12E.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRzdz0kp5wcrwSbLWOEi7S7Vph9KBjJjAEg_woo7NODpZaGkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQTrk_KA1mhs8EI8jE3jX2oXoC3PmCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMMreO8kdISWeh0GkSBnB7QA4Kl-Egr043jo65gMxYmm8w4oa1LeQr0_KszN2ziiIow,file_size=17993]"}
{"time": 1763828878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不是我动（））"}
{"time": 1763828911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033474081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "进了市区，车速慢了下来，不过道路也显然平稳了许多"}
{"time": 1763828938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589374578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=892780521]\"好嘛，不过我最后肯定会帮伊恩想起来的。\"轻轻拍拍他的脑袋，\"相信我就好了。\""}
{"time": 1763829100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898979079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，顺其自然就好啦...”"}
{"time": 1763829499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656362946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?顺其自然咯，当然是说我会赢\""}
{"time": 1763829524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074552648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”有点不太懂舒茉在说什么"}
{"time": 1763829870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314800877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我是说，最后肯定能帮伊恩找到，记忆的。\""}
{"time": 1763829931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335630006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啦...真不用太在意了，也许忘记反而说不定更好呢....”"}
{"time": 1763830034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816001367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不管是什么，都不该忘。\"对于这一点一直是这么认为...\"反正，不准忘。\""}
{"time": 1763830355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091615438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧....也许舒茉是对的...”虽然嘴上说着过去忘了就忘了，但其实还是非常在乎，每次看到舒茉和舒蕾的互动，都会想自己的父母在哪里...他们会是怎么样的人，为什么自己会失忆在林子里醒来，是被抛弃了吗..这些事情一直萦绕在脑海里，虽然很想忽视，但完全做不到"}
{"time": 1763830436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338638141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么叫也许。\"皱起眉头，\"含糊的用词，不是好习惯。\""}
{"time": 1763830496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396488847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...舒茉肯定是对的”认真的看着她"}
{"time": 1763830632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806728596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，记得改啦。\"松开表情，轻飘飘地开口，\"先从用词开始，可以吗\""}
{"time": 1763830712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266136470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...以后不会说那种话了”既然舒茉不喜欢的话"}
{"time": 1763831098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006171082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=266136470]\"这就对了嘛。\"言笑晏晏，\"下车之后打算做什么?我的话，要和妈妈一起。\""}
{"time": 1763831312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079789419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也没什么事情要做吧，圣职者肯定也要去教会找吧，我们等会一起行动呗....在之后的话，再看情况吧”"}
{"time": 1763832700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673538016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1763832720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370054917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2079789419]\"唔...伊恩没有别的地方想看吗？\""}
